# Every endpoint, happy and failure paths, against a database seeded from db/init.sql.
# VS Code REST Client: start the API, then "Send Request" above any case below.
# Every placement carries the Idempotency-Key it is now required to send, and each names a
# logical order of its own — only the two replay pairs share one. So a 201 case re-sent
# under its own key answers 200 with the order it already placed, which is the mechanism
# working rather than the case failing.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 200: the service is up
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 200: search instruments by ticker fragment
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=pam

### 200: search instruments by name fragment
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=banco

### 200: no match is an empty list, not an error
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=zzz

### 400: the search term is required
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments

### 400: a blank search term is no term at all
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=%20%20

### 200: the portfolio of a user, cash plus positions
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/portfolio

### 404: unknown user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999/portfolio

### 400: the user id must be a number
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/abc/portfolio

### 400: an id beyond the range of the id column is turned away, not looked up
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/9999999999/portfolio

### 201 FILLED: a market buy executes at the latest close
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3c9f21ab-buy-pamp-10

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 201 FILLED: a market sell covered by the held shares
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 5d10e7c4-sell-metr-100

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 54, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 100 }

### 201 NEW: a limit buy parks at its limit price
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 9a4b6f02-limit-pamp-900

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "price": 900, "size": 10 }

### 201 REJECTED: the available cash cannot cover the buy
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 1e77c38d-buy-ypfd-10000

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 50, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10000 }

### 201 REJECTED: the held shares cannot cover the sell
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6b2fa951-sell-metr-999

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 54, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 999 }

### 201 FILLED: an amount buys whole shares at the close (10000 / 925.85 = 10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 84c0d3e6-buy-pamp-for-10000

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 10000 }

### 201 NEW: an amount buys whole shares at the limit price (10000 / 900 = 11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: af51b920-limit-pamp-for-10000

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "price": 900, "amount": 10000 }

### 400: the amount does not reach a single share
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 0d6e4a17-amount-below-one-share

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 100 }

### 400: size and amount are exclusive
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 72b8c5f3-size-and-amount

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10, "amount": 10000 }

### 400: one of size or amount is required
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: c41d90e8-neither-size-nor-amount

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET" }

### 400: a limit order needs a price
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 2f8a67b1-limit-without-a-price

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 10 }

### 400: a market order takes no price
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: b903e54c-market-with-a-price

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "price": 900, "size": 10 }

### 400: money below the cent does not exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 48d17fa2-price-below-the-cent

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "price": 900.123, "size": 10 }

### 400: unknown side
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: e6c25b70-side-that-is-not-a-side

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "HOLD", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 400: an order without a userId is malformed, not an order for an unknown user
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 19f4d83b-order-without-a-user

{ "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 400: the currency itself is not tradable
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7ab3e016-buy-the-currency

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 66, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 400: an instrument with no market data has no price to execute at
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: d2059c4f-buy-an-unpriced-instrument

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 3, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 404: an order for an unknown user
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 35e8b1d7-order-for-an-unknown-user

{ "userId": 999, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 404: unknown instrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ca07f462-order-for-an-unknown-instrument

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 9999, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 201 FILLED: the first request under a key — the key names the logical order, not the attempt
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7f3a1c9e-buy-pamp-10

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 200: the same key replays that order instead of placing a second one (send the case above first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7f3a1c9e-buy-pamp-10

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 201 REJECTED: the sell the next case replays — the held shares cannot cover it
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 2b8d05af-sell-metr-999

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 54, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 999 }

### 200: replaying a key returns the rejection it recorded, it does not decide again
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 2b8d05af-sell-metr-999

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 54, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 999 }

### 400: a placement that sends no Idempotency-Key at all
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 400: an Idempotency-Key outside the 1-64 characters of A-Z, a-z, 0-9, _ and -
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: not a key

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 200: cancelling the seeded open order returns it as CANCELLED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/5/cancel

### 409: an order the seed already carries as CANCELLED cannot be cancelled again
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/3/cancel

### 409: a filled order cannot be cancelled
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/cancel

### 404: unknown order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/9999/cancel

### 400: the order id must be a number
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/abc/cancel
